## User

The greatest common divisor of two non-negative integers, by Euclid's algorithm.

## Type

type
```haskell
myGcd :: Int -> Int -> Int
```

## Term

```haskell
myGcd a b = if b == 0 then a else myGcd b (a `mod` b)
```

